⍝ Build demo.dws, a saved workspace (binary), from the source files here.
⍝ Run:  dyalog sample-scripts/file-types/make-workspace.apls
⍝ Then: dyalog sample-scripts/file-types/demo.dws
here←⊃1⎕NPARTS⊃2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
{}⎕FIX'file://',here,'Stats.apln'
{}2⎕FIX'file://',here,'Avg.aplf'
⍝ ⎕LX is the "latent expression": it runs when the workspace is loaded
⎕LX←'⎕←''demo.dws loaded. Try: Stats.Summary 3 1 4 1 5 9'''
⎕SAVE here,'demo.dws'
⎕←'saved ',here,'demo.dws'
